OL,3,GNEWSAFury v Joshua fight to provide
OL,4,A'big boost' to city's economy
OL,5,
OL,6,FBusiness owners expect the much
OL,7,Fanticipated clash between Anthony
OL,8,FJoshua and Tyson Fury to provide a "big
OL,9,Fboost" to the Welsh economy.
OL,11,FThe British heavyweights are set to
OL,12,Ffight on 11 December at the
OL,13,FPrincipality Stadium in Cardiff, with
OL,14,Ffans expected to travel to the Welsh
OL,15,Fcapital from all corners of the globe.
OL,17,FA bar manager intends to order triple
OL,18,Fhis usual amount of beer barrels, but
OL,19,Fsome residents have expressed concern
OL,20,Fabout the impact the fight will have on
OL,21,Fpublic services.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
